{
    "title": "Flower Language Wallpaper",
    "description": "Welcome to Flower Language Wallpaper, the app that allows you to create beautiful, personalized wallpapers containing your name in the symbolic language of flowers or spaces or aquariums or cats.\r\n\r\nFlower Language Wallpaper helps you\r\n- Personalized Lock and Home Screens: Create wallpapers that reflect your name or personality with meaningful flower, space, cat or aquarium arrangements.\r\n- Gifting: Design wallpapers for friends and family with them's name conveyed through the language of flowers, spaces, cats or aquariums.\r\n- Aesthetic Appeal: Beautify your phone with unique designs that are not just visually appealing but also symbolically rich.\r\n\r\nKey Features of Flower Language Wallpaper:\r\nFLOWER BASED LETTERS:\r\n- Create wallpapers that incorporate floral arrangements, each flower conveying a specific letter\r\n- You can type a letter, and the app will translate it into a visual representation using flowers.\r\n- Optional wrapping, favorite flower pot, or adding a bow or name tag to decorate your bouquet further\r\n\r\nSPACE BASED LETTERS:\r\n- Create wallpapers that incorporate planet arrangements, each planet and star conveying a specific letter.\r\n- You can type a letter, and the app will translate it into a visual representation using planets and stars.\r\n- Optional planet, favorite star, or adding your zodiac, or name tag, or nebula to decorate your space further.\r\n\r\nCAT BASED LETTERS:\r\n- Create a wallpaper that reflects your mood or personality by decorating your cat with funny expressions and fun toys.\r\n- You can type a letter, and the app will translate it into a visual representation using cats and toys.\r\n- Optional Cat, favorite Toy, or adding Face, Tree, Rug, Sleeping Bag, Name tag to decorate your cat further.\r\n\r\nAQUARIUM BASED LETTERS:\r\n- Create wallpapers that incorporate aquarium arrangements, each fish or crab conveying a specific letter.\r\n- You can type a letter, and the app will translate it into a visual representation using fishs and crabs or snails, .\r\n- Optional aquarium, favorite fish, or adding crab, snail or coral and name tag to decorate your space further.\r\n\r\nEach flower, space, cat or aquarium in the app is associated with a specific meaning, allowing users to craft wallpapers that look beautiful and carry a deeper significance. Type your letters and see it translated into a stunning design. Customize with your images and enjoy unique layouts. Express yourself through flowers, spaces, cats and aquariums!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to Flower Language Wallpaper, the app that allows you to create beautiful, personalized wallpapers containing your name in the symbolic language of flowers or spaces or aquariums or cats.<br><br>Flower Language Wallpaper helps you<br>- Personalized Lock and Home Screens: Create wallpapers that reflect your name or personality with meaningful flower, space, cat or aquarium arrangements.<br>- Gifting: Design wallpapers for friends and family with them&#39;s name conveyed through the language of flowers, spaces, cats or aquariums.<br>- Aesthetic Appeal: Beautify your phone with unique designs that are not just visually appealing but also symbolically rich.<br><br>Key Features of Flower Language Wallpaper:<br>FLOWER BASED LETTERS:<br>- Create wallpapers that incorporate floral arrangements, each flower conveying a specific letter<br>- You can type a letter, and the app will translate it into a visual representation using flowers.<br>- Optional wrapping, favorite flower pot, or adding a bow or name tag to decorate your bouquet further<br><br>SPACE BASED LETTERS:<br>- Create wallpapers that incorporate planet arrangements, each planet and star conveying a specific letter.<br>- You can type a letter, and the app will translate it into a visual representation using planets and stars.<br>- Optional planet, favorite star, or adding your zodiac, or name tag, or nebula to decorate your space further.<br><br>CAT BASED LETTERS:<br>- Create a wallpaper that reflects your mood or personality by decorating your cat with funny expressions and fun toys.<br>- You can type a letter, and the app will translate it into a visual representation using cats and toys.<br>- Optional Cat, favorite Toy, or adding Face, Tree, Rug, Sleeping Bag, Name tag to decorate your cat further.<br><br>AQUARIUM BASED LETTERS:<br>- Create wallpapers that incorporate aquarium arrangements, each fish or crab conveying a specific letter.<br>- You can type a letter, and the app will 